<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "松开树桩活结将吊篮放低 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-forest-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_forest_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_forest_4_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_forest_4_alt")>><<money 380>>吊篮顺着树杈平稳滑到胸前高度，你轻松取出补给银币并重新拉紧副绳。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你巧解树根副绳安全降下了防熊吊篮。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
