<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>午夜查房后的孤儿院一楼走廊静悄悄的，<<else>>夜深人静的孤儿院楼梯转角处，<</if>>饮水间门口的热水铜箱龙头没拧紧，热水正滴进下方的铁皮接水盘，盘底闪着一枚铜钥与零钱的光泽。
铜箱侧面露出一截生涩的止水阀杆。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁夜色返回 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_3 is 1>>
孤儿院饮水间的热水铜箱龙头今夜已拧紧，走廊安静祥和。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-orphanage-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "垫抹布拧龙头取零钱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_3")>><<money 320>>滴水声戛然而止，你从接水盘里摸出年长院童留下的跑腿谢礼银币。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你拧紧夜半漏水的铜龙头并收起谢礼。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着夜色继续探看 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	热水滴在手背上，烫得你轻轻缩手。<span class="red">你把抹布折厚两层准备再拧。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[屏住呼吸重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回主街口 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拨下止水阀杆再夹出钱币 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_3_alt")>><<money 380>>止水阀一落便断了水流，你毫不沾水地夹出了盘底的银币。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你先关止水阀再取币，干净又利落。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[往深处灯影下走去 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	止水阀杆有些生涩，轻轻发出一点吱呀声。<span class="red">你屏住呼吸慢推阀杆准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准位置再次动手 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回安全处 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Orphanage 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜的孤儿院图书角只留着一盏小夜灯，<<else>>晚间熄灯后的孤儿院公共活动室里，<</if>>旧钢琴谱架后方卡着一只用红线系着的信封，里面是院友们凑给守夜人的宵夜补贴。
<<if $mpClues["mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_3_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁夜色返回 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 is 1>>
孤儿院图书角旧钢琴谱架后的信封今夜已取妥，琴键在夜灯下泛着柔光。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "从谱架后抽出红线信 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_4")>><<money 320>>你未碰响半个琴键便抽出信封，收下了这份温暖的守夜宵夜补贴。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你悄无声息地取出了谱架后的补贴信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁夜色返回歇息 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	衣袖擦过琴键边缘，发出一声极轻的单音。<span class="red">你按住琴键止住余音退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[屏住呼吸重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回主街口 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "合上琴盖平放谱架取信封 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_4_alt")>><<money 380>>键盖合拢后再无走音之虞，你从容放平谱架收起了里面的补贴信封。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你合上键盖稳妥取下了谱架后的信封。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好补贴返回 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	谱架铜合页略紧，放平到一半卡住了。<span class="red">你托住谱架两端准备轻轻抬起再放。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准位置再次动手 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回安全处 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
